---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About the Owner | Bee Balm Productions" description="Meet Josh Nelson, founder of Bee Balm Productions.">
  <section class="container curve-band">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2>Meet Josh Nelson</h2>
      <p>
        Founder of Bee Balm Productions, with 25+ years of experience in web development, digital media, e-learning, and strategic execution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="owner-layout">
      <article class="owner-photo reveal">
        <img src="/images/legacy/Josh-3quarterFace.jpg" alt="Josh Nelson" />
      </article>
      <article class="owner-card reveal">
        <h3>Background</h3>
        <p>
          After Dartmouth, Josh worked with the C. Everett Koop Institute creating public health websites, PSA media, and animation projects,
          including a 20-minute animated film produced with a 10-person team.
        </p>
        <p>
          He later joined the Interactive Media Lab at the Geisel School of Medicine as producer, designer, and 3D animator, eventually
          serving in leadership roles managing award-winning multimedia and web initiatives. That work evolved into World 2 Systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          From 2010 to 2014, Josh helped build infrastructure and business translation support under the NIH-backed TREAT initiative,
          guiding over 100 innovators evaluating health-care product ideas. Bee Balm Productions was founded in 2014 from that experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2020, he was recruited as the fourth Executive Director of Claremont Community Television, helping modernize studio hardware,
          software, lighting, and server infrastructure as it transitioned toward the Claremont Community Media Center.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <article class="panel reveal owner-leadership">
      <h3>Leadership style</h3>
      <p>
        Collaborative, calm, and solutions-oriented. Projects are run with transparency and a focus on outcomes people can see and measure.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/services">View Services</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/contact">Connect</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="container curve-band">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2>Career path infographic</h2>
      <p>A quick look at the progression that shaped Bee Balm's approach.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="infographic-flow">
      <article class="info-node reveal"><h3>Public Health Media</h3><p>Web, film, and animation initiatives at Dartmouth programs.</p></article>
      <article class="info-node reveal"><h3>Lab + Production Leadership</h3><p>Interactive Media Lab and cross-functional project management.</p></article>
      <article class="info-node reveal"><h3>NIH Innovation Support</h3><p>TREAT business development and product translation for 100+ teams.</p></article>
      <article class="info-node reveal"><h3>Bee Balm + CCMC</h3><p>Studio growth, web execution, and media center modernization leadership.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>